<title>GERMANY: GfN IPO price set at 32.0 marks.</title>
<headline>GfN IPO price set at 32.0 marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Berlin stock exchange said on Tuesday that the issue price for the initial public offering (IPO) of shares in training firm Gesellschaft Fuer Network Training (GfN) had been set at 32 marks.</p>
<p>GfN is due to issue around 280,000 shares which will be listed on the Berlin exchange from Wednesday.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the exchange said the offer was 70 times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
